This wrapper forks the Disney Crossy Road 32-bit Switch wrapper (MIT) and
descends from the open-source Switch .so-loader lineage by Andy Nguyen
(TheOfficialFloW) and fgsfds (MIT), informed by vita2hos by xerpi. Inherited
files retain their upstream notices. source/nx32_virtmem.c is a fixed copy of
libnx's kernel/virtmem.c (ISC, libnx authors).

Not covered by this license:
- mod/: the PvZ TV Touch mod (libHomura) by ZombieYetis and the PvZ TV Touch
  Team, with this port's changes, GPL-3.0 (mod/LICENSE). The launcher NRO
  carries a build of it.
- FFmpeg, linked into the game program for the intro video, LGPL-2.1.
- tools/fonts/DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf, under its own license
  (tools/fonts/LICENSE_DEJAVU).

